	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"HGマジンガーZ（INFINITY Ver.）とHGグレートマジンガー(INFINITY Ver.）の制作ノウハウを注ぎ込んだ「HG グレンダイザー（INFINITISM）」が登場！",
			"• 『劇場版 マジンガーZ／INFINITY』のメカデザイナー柳瀬敬之氏による描き起しデザインを完全新規造形で立体化。",
			"• 頭部は細かなパーツ分割で色分けを再現。",
			"• 迫力のアクションシーンを実現するKPS素材による関節パーツを搭載。",
			"• 装甲パーツの可動により、腕部を自然に曲げることができる。",
			"• 付属するダブルハーケンを取り外すことでシングルハーケン形態の再現も可能。",
			"• クリアパーツの裏側にも加工を施し、精密感を演出。",
			"• 主要武装の他に、ハンドパーツ左右×２種、ダブルスペイザーが付属。",
			"• 付属のダブルスペイザーと合体、更に台座と組み合わせて飛行状態を再現できる。首周りの広い可動域により自然な飛行ポーズが可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"HG Grendizer (INFINITISM)\", which incorporates the production know-how of HG Mazinger Z (INFINITY Ver.) and HG Great Mazinger (INFINITY Ver.), is now available!",
			"• The design drawn by mechanical designer Noriyuki Yanase of ``Mazinger Z/INFINITY the Movie'' is now three-dimensional with a completely new model.",
			"• The head is divided into detailed parts to reproduce color coding.",
			"• Equipped with joint parts made of KPS material to realize powerful action scenes.",
			"• The arm can be bent naturally by moving the armor parts.",
			"• Single Harken form can be reproduced by removing the included Double Harken.",
			"• The back side of the clear parts is also processed to create a sense of precision.",
			"• In addition to the main weapons, 2 types of hand parts (left and right) and a double spazer are included.",
			"• Can be combined with the included double spacer and further combined with the pedestal to recreate the flight state. The wide range of motion around the neck allows for natural flying poses."
		]
	},
